    {
      "name": "ct_reconcile",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "RECONCILIATION: the written record vs the actual coin. discrepancy = treasury.coin - ledger.recorded; reconciled iff 0. Every legitimate move (tax in, salary out) is recorded, so an honest, diligent clerk reconciles to 0. An unrecorded transaction (actual > recorded) or embezzlement (recorded > actual) shows up as a non-zero discrepancy -- the books do not balance themselves, and the gap is found.",
